    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": null,
    "course_pol_en": "1.\t尊重他人：尊重老師和同學，不要打斷他人發言，適時表達自己的觀點，並尊重不同意見。 2. 注意言談舉止：講話要有禮貌，不使用粗言穢語或冒犯性的語言，不進行打鬧或干擾他人。 3. 準時到達：按時到達課堂，不要遲到或提早離開，以免打擾到其他人。 4. 課程請假：若因故無法參加上課，請事先向老師說明情況。\n2.\tRespect others: Respect teachers and classmates, do not interrupt others, express your opinions in a timely manner, and respect different opinions.\n3.\tPay attention to your speech and behavior: You must speak politely, do not use foul language or offensive language, and do not engage in joking or disturbing others.\n4.\tArrive on time: Arrive at class on time and do not be late or leave early so as not to disturb others.\n5.\tCourse leave: If you are unable to attend class for any reason, please explain the situation to the teacher in advance.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": null,
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>1. Please respect intellectual property rights.<br />\n2. All reports must clearly cite their sources (Word, PPT). Please refer to the relevant format.<br />\n3. When using generative AI (such as ChatGPT) materials, please clearly indicate the cited content to avoid biases in teachers&#39; interpretation of individual abilities.</div>\n\n<div>1.請遵守智慧財產權&nbsp;<br />\n2.所有報告引用資料請務必註明出處(word, PPT)，相關格式可參考&nbsp;<br />\n3.使用生成式AI (如ChatGPT)資料，請務必明確標示出所引用之內容，避免教師對個人能力解讀上之偏誤。</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "Y"
  },
